    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgXZh374CyEjlwCTC4oK8Zq0iPo2.png" alt=""><p><span>我们常把“好沉”与“好重”、“掉点儿”与“落雨”的差别，归于各地的说话习惯。词语深处，却沉积着山川阻隔与人口迁徙的历史。</span></p><p><span>从衣冠南渡到湖广填四川，语言随人群迁移，在平原交汇，在山地分流。</span></p><p><span>今天的乡音里，仍然回响着祖先走过的山河。</span></p><p><span>「本期制作人」</span></p><p><span>梁州</span></p><p><span>「关于《梁州令》」</span></p><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7805182916" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7805182916"><span>中文播客梁州令</span></a></p><p><span>公众号：梁州令</span></p><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63450b02000000001802c3e5?xsec_token=YBRl_yjS0EbThBIFX4ZgGQGjOhH7--Bo9hIzoPxTrYHjI=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63450b02000000001802c3e5&amp;apptime=1756434595&amp;share_id=ce18127f29c44613a51a404c7e484f43" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63450b02000000001802c3e5?xsec_token=YBRl_yjS0EbThBIFX4ZgGQGjOhH7--Bo9hIzoPxTrYHjI=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63450b02000000001802c3e5&amp;apptime=1756434595&amp;share_id=ce18127f29c44613a51a404c7e484f43"><span>梁州令</span></a></p><p></p>]]></description>
