    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgXZh374CyEjlwCTC4oK8Zq0iPo2.png" alt=""><p><span>一个人渴望磕CP，并不代表他渴望进入一段情感关系。人不必亲自走进每一种幸福，才能理解幸福。有时候，隔着一段恰到好处的距离，看见爱可能存在，本身就是一种完整的快乐。</span></p><p><span>「本期制作人」</span></p><p><span>梁州</span></p><p><span>「关于《梁州令》」</span></p><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7805182916" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7805182916"><span>中文播客梁州令</span></a></p><p><span>公众号：梁州令</span></p><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63450b02000000001802c3e5?xsec_token=YBRl_yjS0EbThBIFX4ZgGQGjOhH7--Bo9hIzoPxTrYHjI=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63450b02000000001802c3e5&amp;apptime=1756434595&amp;share_id=ce18127f29c44613a51a404c7e484f43" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63450b02000000001802c3e5?xsec_token=YBRl_yjS0EbThBIFX4ZgGQGjOhH7--Bo9hIzoPxTrYHjI=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63450b02000000001802c3e5&amp;apptime=1756434595&amp;share_id=ce18127f29c44613a51a404c7e484f43"><span>梁州令</span></a></p><p><span>喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/苹果Podcasts：梁州令</span></p>]]></description>
