    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ac9b224195d838e2aef96cf</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 03:42:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgXZh374CyEjlwCTC4oK8Zq0iPo2.png" alt=""><p><span>我们习惯用“入土为安”理解死亡。古代草原墓葬中的马匹，却让死亡有了继续远行的意味。从斯基泰人的墓冢、北欧船葬，到现代医院中的临终，人类始终在为离别寻找语言。迁徙、远航与归乡，构成了彼岸的模样:我们如何生活，也塑造着我们如何想象死亡。</span></p><p><span>「本期制作人」</span></p><p><span>梁州</span></p><p><span>「关于《梁州令》」</span></p><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7805182916" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7805182916"><span>中文播客梁州令</span></a></p><p><span>公众号：梁州令</span></p><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63450b02000000001802c3e5?xsec_token=YBRl_yjS0EbThBIFX4ZgGQGjOhH7--Bo9hIzoPxTrYHjI=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63450b02000000001802c3e5&amp;apptime=1756434595&amp;share_id=ce18127f29c44613a51a404c7e484f43" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63450b02000000001802c3e5?xsec_token=YBRl_yjS0EbThBIFX4ZgGQGjOhH7--Bo9hIzoPxTrYHjI=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63450b02000000001802c3e5&amp;apptime=1756434595&amp;share_id=ce18127f29c44613a51a404c7e484f43"><span>梁州令</span></a></p><p><span>喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/苹果Podcasts：梁州令</span></p>]]></description>
