  <item>
    <title>EP43：AI的兴起不该成为刺向孩童的弯刀</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aaf479aac389df827348549</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aaf479aac389df827348549</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 02:44:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgXZh374CyEjlwCTC4oK8Zq0iPo2.png" alt=""><p><span>当谷歌、opeanAI这些科技巨头争夺未来时，率先被影响的，其实是农田、河流与普通人的日常生活。这些数据中心消耗的每一滴水，最终都会落在更遥远、更沉默的地方——落在玉米地里，落在干涸的含水层里，落在一个孩子追问“为什么水是咸的”的早晨里。</span></p><p><span>「本期制作人」</span></p><p><span>梁州</span></p><p><span>「关于《梁州令》」</span></p><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7805182916" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7805182916"><span>中文播客梁州令</span></a></p><p><span>公众号：梁州令</span></p><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63450b02000000001802c3e5?xsec_token=YBRl_yjS0EbThBIFX4ZgGQGjOhH7--Bo9hIzoPxTrYHjI=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63450b02000000001802c3e5&amp;apptime=1756434595&amp;share_id=ce18127f29c44613a51a404c7e484f43" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63450b02000000001802c3e5?xsec_token=YBRl_yjS0EbThBIFX4ZgGQGjOhH7--Bo9hIzoPxTrYHjI=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63450b02000000001802c3e5&amp;apptime=1756434595&amp;share_id=ce18127f29c44613a51a404c7e484f43"><span>梁州令</span></a></p><p><span>喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/苹果Podcasts：梁州令</span></p>]]></description>
